itle\":\"https://www.turkishdrama.com/love-in-the-sky-yer-gok-ask.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d113\"},\"ref\":\"d113\",\"snippet\":\" ... Saadet Isıl Aksoy (born August 29, 1983, Istanbul, Turkey) - turkish actress. Turkish TV series \\\"The Magnificent Century\\\" brought her fame in the world. Other movies with her participation: \\\"Eggs\\\", \\\"Beautiful Life\\\", \\\"Milk\\\", \\\"Eastern Plays\\\", \\\"Love in other languages.\\\"\\n\\n37. Tugba Melis (born September 7, 1990, Sofia) - actress and ... \",\"title\":\"https://beauty-around.com/en/tops/item/60-samyue-krasivyie-turkey-actress\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d114\"},\"ref\":\"d114\",\"snippet\":\" ... La herencia de Flora) (2024) – Peruvian biographical historical drama film telling the story of Flora Tristan\\n* Joan (2024) – British biographical drama miniseries about real-life character Joan Hannington, a figure known as \\\"the Godmother\\\" by certain aspects of the British criminal underworld\\n* Joy (2024) – British biographical drama film ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_2020s_films_based_on_actual_events\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d115\"},\"ref\":\"d115\",\"snippet\":\" ... The results include some very believable performances since the actors helped create the characters. And cinematographer Dick Pope's unceremonious photography underscores the film's docu-drama aesthetic. Marianne Jean-Baptiste received an Academy Award nomination for Best Supporting Actress, making her the first Black British actress to ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.indiewire.com/feature/cannes-film-festival-palme-d-or-winners-m